sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant R as Rovai
  participant I as Implementer
  participant V as Reviewer
  participant F as Project files
    U->>R: Select implementer + send scope
    R->>I: Deliver request; claim execution
    I->>F: Edit + check files
    I->>U: Implementation summary and limits
    U->>V: Select reviewer + send review request
    V->>F: Inspect the same files (read-only)
    V->>U: Actual findings or no findings
  opt A verified finding needs a fix
    U->>I: Optional: request a bounded fix
  end
    U->>F: Inspect the final page and changes
